        "text": "**Analyzing Conditional Updates**\n\nI'm now diving into `conditional_update.py`. The focus is on implementing conditional updates to DynamoDB documents using the `update_item` operation. This involves understanding how to structure the conditional expressions for safe and reliable modifications.\n\n\n",
